= Reorganization Of The <span style="color: [+ ldr_colour +];">[+ ldr_full_italian +]</span>

The <span style="color: [+ ldr_colour +];">Liberals, Democrats, and Radicals</span> under Orlando and Nitti, have reorganised themselves, alongside the remnants of the PRS, under a new party from its current state as an electoral list, known as the <span style="color: [+ ldr_colour +];">[+ ldr_full_name +]</span>. The party still represents its former ideals, though it seems there will be a new party congress soon to establish its leadership, where Nitti, Salandra, and Orlando are expected to run.

- @root: <span style="color: [+ ldr_colour +];">Liberals</span>, <span style="color: [+ ldr_colour +];">liberals</span>, <span style="color: [+ ldr_colour +];">liberals</span>...
